WEBVTT

00:00:02.240 --> 00:00:05.330
I wonder what it will be?

00:00:05.330 --> 00:00:07.290
This week, it's this!

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:09.850
That's my card!

00:00:09.850 --> 00:00:12.560
It allows you to add an Equip 
Spell Card to your hand.

00:00:12.560 --> 00:00:14.710
And it also has another incredible effect!

00:00:34.760 --> 00:00:35.980
Yusei…

00:00:39.140 --> 00:00:41.270
Dr. Schmidt, how's Yusei?

00:00:42.010 --> 00:00:44.480
He's very lucky.

00:00:44.480 --> 00:00:47.270
There are no injuries to his 
internal organs or blood vessels.

00:00:47.680 --> 00:00:50.040
Once his wounds heal, he'll be fine.

00:00:51.290 --> 00:00:52.460
Really?

00:00:53.040 --> 00:00:54.160
Thank goodness.

00:00:55.700 --> 00:00:58.230
How dare Yusei make us worry!

00:01:02.980 --> 00:01:04.080
Ah-choo!

00:01:04.580 --> 00:01:05.590
What's wrong?

00:01:05.590 --> 00:01:08.300
I think I have a fever.

00:01:10.350 --> 00:01:12.720
What?  Pull yourself together!

00:01:25.910 --> 00:01:30.650
Looking over a vast distance

00:01:30.910 --> 00:01:35.750
I realized my field of vision was narrow

00:01:36.020 --> 00:01:40.660
Even if it’s easier to throw myself away

00:01:41.020 --> 00:01:45.430
I want to survive to the best of my abilities

00:01:47.300 --> 00:01:50.800
No matter how bad today is

00:01:52.370 --> 00:01:55.780
There’s still the faintest light

00:01:57.540 --> 00:02:01.180
All I have to do tomorrow

00:02:01.480 --> 00:02:05.250
Is light it myself

00:02:05.550 --> 00:02:10.250
I test myself so I won’t stop or vanish

00:02:10.620 --> 00:02:15.220
Even if I get countless scars

00:02:15.720 --> 00:02:21.520
I ride wishing for the 
arrival of a true tomorrow

00:02:21.830 --> 00:02:25.500
Today will never exist again

00:02:25.840 --> 00:02:31.410
So I won’t stop or vanish

00:02:58.140 --> 00:03:04.130
Courage and Power Dock Together!
Synchro Summon!  Power Tool Dragon

00:03:10.130 --> 00:03:11.810
What an incredible house!

00:03:11.810 --> 00:03:14.020
You said that your parents are away?

00:03:14.260 --> 00:03:19.360
Yeah.  Papa and Mama have to fly all over 
the world, so they rarely come home.

00:03:19.360 --> 00:03:23.270
Our house is your house.  
We have a lot of free rooms.

00:03:25.950 --> 00:03:29.940
Luca is physically weak, so 
she doesn't like going out.

00:03:29.940 --> 00:03:34.720
I can't leave her all alone, so I can't 
go out either.  I was getting bored.

00:03:34.720 --> 00:03:35.710
I see.

00:03:36.270 --> 00:03:39.300
Himuro, there's a clear 
view of the City from here.

00:03:40.010 --> 00:03:44.610
We might be able to receive a 
transmission from Saiga in Satellite.

00:03:46.740 --> 00:03:50.300
If what Luca sensed was 
real, does that mean Yusei

00:03:50.300 --> 00:03:53.700
has already started to battle 
against the Dark Signers?

00:03:53.700 --> 00:03:58.570
Our outgoing transmissions are unstable, 
so we have to wait until they contact us.

00:03:58.570 --> 00:04:00.300
Did Yusei win?

00:04:00.300 --> 00:04:03.730
I don't know, but he's not the 
type who would lose easily.

00:04:04.500 --> 00:04:05.960
You're right!

00:04:05.960 --> 00:04:09.340
Isn't there anything I can do to help?

00:04:09.340 --> 00:04:11.970
Hey, about Luca's dream...

00:04:12.840 --> 00:04:16.220
The story about the Crimson Dragon 
who battled against the evil gods?

00:04:17.550 --> 00:04:18.480
Yeah.

00:04:18.480 --> 00:04:23.210
Maybe the power of the Signers 
showed the ancient battle to Luca.

00:04:32.010 --> 00:04:35.680
Is it true that Power Tool 
Dragon appeared in your dream?

00:04:38.070 --> 00:04:40.150
Well, it did look similar.

00:04:40.650 --> 00:04:41.900
But it doesn't matter.

00:04:41.900 --> 00:04:43.340
It does matter!

00:04:43.340 --> 00:04:51.120
Since I have that Dragon card, it 
could mean that I'm the final Signer!

00:04:51.120 --> 00:04:54.450
I hope that mark appears on me soon!

00:04:54.450 --> 00:04:57.770
The mark!  The dragon mark!

00:04:55.110 --> 00:04:56.550
Is that true?

00:04:56.550 --> 00:05:00.770
There's no way a robot dragon 
would appear in an ancient ritual.

00:05:00.770 --> 00:05:01.840
That's true.

00:05:01.410 --> 00:05:03.650
Appear!

00:05:03.670 --> 00:05:05.030
Maybe it's on my left arm!

00:05:05.030 --> 00:05:08.960
Appear!  I said appear!

00:05:05.450 --> 00:05:08.960
I only said that to cheer Leo up.

00:05:10.050 --> 00:05:15.770
Oh yeah!  Since I'm the fifth Signer, 
I have to be more responsible!

00:05:15.770 --> 00:05:19.730
No matter what happens, 
I have to protect Luca!

00:05:19.730 --> 00:05:22.170
Leave everything to me!

00:05:28.160 --> 00:05:31.350
Since the Crimson Dragon battles against the

00:05:31.350 --> 00:05:34.350
evil gods, does that mean 
that the Signers are a team?

00:05:34.350 --> 00:05:40.280
Yes.  Bro, Jack, Luca and Aki.

00:05:40.280 --> 00:05:41.580
And me!

00:05:41.580 --> 00:05:43.040
That's right.

00:05:43.040 --> 00:05:45.920
That can't be right.  If 
Aki Izayoi is part of the

00:05:45.920 --> 00:05:48.920
team, that means Arcadia Movement 
is also part of the team.

00:05:49.290 --> 00:05:51.680
What's Arcadia Movement?

00:05:52.050 --> 00:05:53.610
I don't hear good things about them.

00:05:53.890 --> 00:05:59.130
It's rumored that they gather psychic 
duelists and do mysterious experiments.

00:05:59.130 --> 00:06:00.830
Psychic duelists?

00:06:01.840 --> 00:06:06.410
I heard that there are duelists 
with special abilities.

00:06:06.750 --> 00:06:09.120
Why is Aki there?

00:06:09.120 --> 00:06:12.760
Who knows.  She must have a reason.

00:06:15.340 --> 00:06:19.590
Let's ask Aki to cooperate with us!

00:06:19.590 --> 00:06:20.660
What?

00:06:20.660 --> 00:06:23.540
It's only a rumor that they're 
doing mysterious things.

00:06:23.920 --> 00:06:26.850
There's no reason to accuse them yet.

00:06:26.850 --> 00:06:28.770
That's true, but…

00:06:28.770 --> 00:06:31.690
Come to think of it, you're right.

00:06:31.690 --> 00:06:35.200
We adults are too suspicious of other people.

00:06:35.200 --> 00:06:39.030
I guess it doesn't hurt to 
tell her about our situation.

00:06:39.370 --> 00:06:43.040
But how do we get in contact 
with Arcadia Movement?

00:06:43.040 --> 00:06:45.190
I'll check Saiga's data.

00:06:45.350 --> 00:06:48.350
He's a master when it comes 
to gathering information.

00:07:05.640 --> 00:07:09.250
Recently, Izayoi's power 
has continued to decrease.

00:07:09.940 --> 00:07:15.580
The violence in her heart is directly 
connected to her psychic dueling power.

00:07:15.580 --> 00:07:20.950
Emotions are the best way to keep 
feeding her energy for revenge.

00:07:20.950 --> 00:07:23.210
Did she have a change of heart?

00:07:24.590 --> 00:07:27.730
I know the cause.

00:07:29.960 --> 00:07:31.020
What's wrong?

00:07:31.020 --> 00:07:32.780
Do you feel sick?

00:07:33.470 --> 00:07:34.400
No.

00:07:34.400 --> 00:07:35.900
Tell me what's bothering you.

00:07:36.150 --> 00:07:39.390
We're friends.  There's no 
need to hide anything from me.

00:07:40.410 --> 00:07:42.030
Nothing is bothering me.

00:07:42.270 --> 00:07:46.920
Aki, psychic duelists like 
us are social outcasts.

00:07:47.610 --> 00:07:51.410
Though we didn't want these 
powers, we were born with them.

00:07:51.870 --> 00:07:58.620
And due to these powers, our friends, 
parents and society discriminate against us.

00:08:05.050 --> 00:08:07.120
You were always alone.

00:08:08.080 --> 00:08:14.410
In order to create a home for people 
like you, I created Arcadia Movement.

00:08:14.990 --> 00:08:17.360
I understand you.

00:08:17.890 --> 00:08:22.010
Only I can stop the anger within you.

00:08:22.410 --> 00:08:23.870
I know.

00:08:25.870 --> 00:08:27.810
Yusei cannot save you.

00:08:30.680 --> 00:08:32.770
I'm the one who rescued you.

00:08:32.990 --> 00:08:37.210
I'm the one who gave you a home 
when you had nowhere to go.

00:08:37.750 --> 00:08:40.350
Don't forget that you owe 
me a debt of gratitude.

00:08:45.750 --> 00:08:46.840
What is it?

00:08:46.840 --> 00:08:49.900
Master Divine, a man named 
Himuro wants to meet you.

00:08:50.560 --> 00:08:53.560
Himuro?  The former pro duelist?

00:08:59.600 --> 00:09:04.120
I'll keep taking it!  Send 
out all your sadness!

00:09:04.780 --> 00:09:07.200
Why am I thinking about him?

00:09:14.860 --> 00:09:19.620
Yusei, taste the curse of the dead!

00:09:19.620 --> 00:09:21.640
My Earthbound Immortal Ccapac Apu!

00:09:21.640 --> 00:09:25.540
Swing the steel hammer of justice 
on our enemy, the Signers!

00:09:34.080 --> 00:09:34.930
Where am I?

00:09:38.220 --> 00:09:39.420
Are you awake?

00:09:39.420 --> 00:09:41.230
Martha?  I…

00:09:41.230 --> 00:09:43.910
You were hurt, so Crow brought you here.

00:09:43.910 --> 00:09:44.740
Crow?

00:09:46.150 --> 00:09:48.540
I remember.  Kiryu and I were…

00:09:49.420 --> 00:09:53.590
The doctor said that it was a miracle 
that you only had a few wounds.

00:09:56.940 --> 00:09:59.570
Rally and the others pushed it here.

00:09:59.570 --> 00:10:00.660
Rally?

00:10:00.660 --> 00:10:05.230
They all came down with a cold.  
Make sure to thank them later.

00:10:05.230 --> 00:10:07.440
Crow left quickly.

00:10:07.870 --> 00:10:10.600
You kids are so ungrateful.

00:10:10.600 --> 00:10:13.920
Once you learn how to talk, 
you push aside the parents who

00:10:13.920 --> 00:10:17.420
raised you so that you can focus 
on building those machines.

00:10:17.800 --> 00:10:20.380
Then you leave and go to dangerous places.

00:10:20.630 --> 00:10:22.750
I'm shocked speechless.

00:10:23.940 --> 00:10:26.260
What's your reason?

00:10:26.930 --> 00:10:31.580
I was investigating why people 
from Satellite were vanishing.

00:10:32.140 --> 00:10:34.080
It has something to do 
with the former Moment.

00:10:34.080 --> 00:10:35.610
The former Moment?

00:10:35.610 --> 00:10:40.860
But that area is dangerous.  Can 
you handle it all by yourself?

00:10:40.860 --> 00:10:41.970
I don't know.

00:10:41.970 --> 00:10:43.450
That's not like you.

00:10:43.450 --> 00:10:47.630
If you can't handle it alone, then why 
are you trying to do it all by yourself?

00:10:47.630 --> 00:10:52.340
Jack and Crow were raised as your 
brothers.  They can help you.

00:10:52.340 --> 00:10:55.020
Why don't you want their help?

00:10:56.300 --> 00:11:01.990
When you lived here, you were honest with 
your feelings and believed in your friends.

00:11:01.990 --> 00:11:07.360
Yusei, there are times when a man has 
to do impossible missions on his own.

00:11:07.360 --> 00:11:11.490
However, no matter how impossible 
the task, your friends

00:11:11.490 --> 00:11:15.490
will help you as long as you 
believe in what you're doing.

00:11:15.890 --> 00:11:17.490
Eat.

00:11:19.430 --> 00:11:21.690
Martha, thank you.

00:11:21.690 --> 00:11:27.430
Listen, Yusei!  If you try to leave before 
your wounds heal, then I'll pummel you!

00:11:31.520 --> 00:11:32.670
Friends…

00:11:40.800 --> 00:11:43.910
Do you remember if we're supposed to use 
knives and forks from the outside in?

00:11:43.910 --> 00:11:45.510
We didn't come here to eat.

00:11:45.510 --> 00:11:46.410
That's right.

00:11:46.840 --> 00:11:49.870
That's an interesting 
story.  A group known as

00:11:49.870 --> 00:11:53.370
the Dark Signers is trying 
to conquer Domino City?

00:11:53.590 --> 00:11:57.070
That's right, and the 
Signers are fighting them!

00:11:57.070 --> 00:11:59.840
That's why we want Aki to help us.

00:12:00.090 --> 00:12:04.430
Since she also has the 
mark, she can save Yusei!

00:12:04.620 --> 00:12:06.830
Have you received any contact from Yusei?

00:12:06.830 --> 00:12:08.150
Not yet.

00:12:09.960 --> 00:12:14.080
Fine.  We will do everything 
we can to help you.

00:12:14.080 --> 00:12:15.040
Really?

00:12:16.640 --> 00:12:20.780
Arcadia Movement does research 
on psychic duels, but we're

00:12:20.780 --> 00:12:25.780
facing trouble because people 
spread false rumors about us.

00:12:25.780 --> 00:12:28.890
If we can help you, then we'll gladly do it!

00:12:29.160 --> 00:12:29.900
Hooray!

00:12:29.900 --> 00:12:31.120
Thank goodness!

00:12:31.710 --> 00:12:33.990
Oh yeah, I'll bring her.

00:12:33.990 --> 00:12:35.700
I'll return soon.  Excuse me.

00:12:39.420 --> 00:12:43.940
How's that!  Just like I 
thought, he's not a bad person!

00:12:44.200 --> 00:12:47.580
I'm surprised it went 
so quickly and smoothly.

00:12:47.580 --> 00:12:51.590
It's unexpected, but we 
shouldn't let our guard down.

00:12:52.580 --> 00:12:55.050
Why do adults have to be 
so suspicious of others?

00:12:55.580 --> 00:12:58.770
Anyway, what about the 
meal?  I'm really hungry!

00:12:59.140 --> 00:13:01.480
Lua, sit quietly.

00:13:01.480 --> 00:13:03.790
I'm suddenly sleepy.

00:13:03.790 --> 00:13:05.100
Me too.

00:13:06.210 --> 00:13:06.930
Hey!

00:13:06.930 --> 00:13:08.840
I'm also…

00:13:08.840 --> 00:13:09.780
Grandpa!

00:13:10.410 --> 00:13:11.740
What's going on…

00:13:17.400 --> 00:13:23.410
Luca, I always wanted to make you 
a member of Arcadia Movement.

00:13:23.810 --> 00:13:27.610
This is what it means by "a moth to a flame."

00:13:57.630 --> 00:13:58.580
Aki.

00:13:58.740 --> 00:14:00.580
Be quiet and watch.

00:14:11.610 --> 00:14:12.490
Lua!

00:14:12.720 --> 00:14:13.810
What are you doing?

00:14:13.810 --> 00:14:14.690
It's a test.

00:14:14.690 --> 00:14:15.940
A test?

00:14:19.100 --> 00:14:22.400
What is this?  What are you 
planning to do with me?

00:14:22.400 --> 00:14:26.950
Luca has a mysterious ability that 
allows her to speak with the spirits.

00:14:26.950 --> 00:14:30.600
Since you're her twin, you might 
also have a hidden ability.

00:14:30.910 --> 00:14:33.050
That's why I'm going to test you.

00:14:33.220 --> 00:14:37.630
You were lying when you said that 
you'll help us fight the Dark Signers?

00:14:37.630 --> 00:14:41.270
Sorry, but I have no interest 
in the Dark Signers.

00:14:41.490 --> 00:14:43.030
You tricked us!

00:14:45.930 --> 00:14:48.160
Luca!  Run away, Luca!

00:14:48.160 --> 00:14:50.980
They can't hear what we're saying.

00:14:50.980 --> 00:14:53.690
What is Arcadia Movement?

00:14:54.030 --> 00:14:59.330
I believe that by training psychic duelists, 
they'll become excellent soldiers.

00:14:59.350 --> 00:15:00.040
Soldiers?

00:15:00.040 --> 00:15:02.940
That's right.  Psychic soldiers.

00:15:02.940 --> 00:15:09.210
The powers of psychic duelists increase by 
dueling, and then I'll lend out the soldiers.

00:15:09.210 --> 00:15:11.690
They'll accomplish remarkable tasks.

00:15:11.850 --> 00:15:13.120
No way…

00:15:13.570 --> 00:15:17.690
The psychic duelists will shape the world.

00:15:17.690 --> 00:15:20.630
Interesting, isn't it?  
This is how we'll get our

00:15:20.630 --> 00:15:24.130
revenge against the people 
who discriminated against us!

00:15:24.390 --> 00:15:26.920
Using duels as war?

00:15:27.660 --> 00:15:29.340
Aki knew about this and was fine with it?

00:15:29.580 --> 00:15:32.770
She doesn't know yet.

00:15:33.060 --> 00:15:35.770
Now let's begin your test.

00:15:37.230 --> 00:15:38.220
My Duel Disk…

00:15:39.920 --> 00:15:43.960
My test is dangerous, so show 
no mercy when you attack me.

00:15:46.010 --> 00:15:46.910
Here I go!

00:15:47.330 --> 00:15:48.530
Duel!

00:15:50.050 --> 00:15:51.320
My turn!

00:15:52.250 --> 00:15:53.820
I summon Krebons.

00:15:56.670 --> 00:15:59.780
Then I set one card and end my turn.

00:15:59.780 --> 00:16:01.530
Now it's your turn.

00:16:01.750 --> 00:16:05.730
Dammit, fine!  You have no 
problems with me winning, do you?

00:16:06.420 --> 00:16:07.510
That's the spirit.

00:16:07.960 --> 00:16:11.790
My turn!  I summon Morphtronic Radion!

00:16:13.150 --> 00:16:19.260
When this card is in attack position, 
Morphtronic monsters on my field gain 800 attack points!

00:16:23.170 --> 00:16:27.180
Now it has more attack points 
than yours!  Go, Radion!

00:16:27.690 --> 00:16:29.600
Earphone Shoot!

00:16:30.030 --> 00:16:32.130
Krebons's effect activates!

00:16:32.130 --> 00:16:35.410
When this card is the target of attack, I can

00:16:35.410 --> 00:16:38.910
negate your monster's attack 
by paying 800 life points.

00:16:41.720 --> 00:16:44.810
He sacrificed his own 
life to keep his monster.

00:16:45.180 --> 00:16:46.240
I end my turn!

00:16:46.460 --> 00:16:47.760
My turn!

00:16:47.760 --> 00:16:49.750
I summon Psychic Snail!

00:16:52.570 --> 00:16:54.670
1900 attack points?

00:16:54.780 --> 00:16:57.860
It's time I get a little serious.

00:16:57.860 --> 00:17:00.440
Psychic Snail attacks Radion!

00:17:00.440 --> 00:17:02.380
Snail Thunder!

00:17:06.150 --> 00:17:09.080
I actually felt an impact...

00:17:09.080 --> 00:17:14.000
Psychic duels are completely different 
than your duels.  Be careful.

00:17:15.030 --> 00:17:17.740
Krebons, attack him directly!

00:17:25.450 --> 00:17:26.250
Lua!

00:17:26.250 --> 00:17:27.930
Why are you doing such 
horrible things to him?

00:17:28.220 --> 00:17:29.430
This is a test.

00:17:29.590 --> 00:17:33.490
When he feels cornered, 
his powers may awaken.

00:17:33.930 --> 00:17:35.180
But…

00:17:35.340 --> 00:17:38.130
It hurts!

00:17:39.140 --> 00:17:40.980
Hurry up and stand up, kid!

00:17:41.330 --> 00:17:43.750
You don't understand the situation.

00:17:44.970 --> 00:17:50.500
Since I told you our secrets, I can't 
guarantee that I'll let you live!

00:17:51.080 --> 00:17:52.060
What?

00:17:52.060 --> 00:17:57.540
If you want to live, then attack me as if 
your life depends on it.  Awaken your abilities!

00:17:58.660 --> 00:18:00.040
My abilities…

00:18:00.650 --> 00:18:04.850
No matter what happens, 
I have to protect Luca!

00:18:07.000 --> 00:18:11.630
That's right!  No matter 
what, I will protect Luna!

00:18:11.970 --> 00:18:13.650
That's the spirit.

00:18:13.650 --> 00:18:19.740
Many psychic duelists awaken their powers 
when they realize what they need to protect.

00:18:19.740 --> 00:18:22.000
Now show me your power!

00:18:22.160 --> 00:18:23.250
My turn!

00:18:25.030 --> 00:18:27.980
I summon Morphtronic Remoten!

00:18:30.290 --> 00:18:33.640
Then I activate the 
Continuous Spell Junk Box!

00:18:33.640 --> 00:18:37.180
Due to Junk Box's effect, I Special 
Summon Morphtronic Radion!

00:18:38.980 --> 00:18:42.920
Level 3 Remoten tunes Level 4 Radion!

00:18:45.680 --> 00:18:50.550
In order to protect world peace, 
courage and power dock together!

00:18:51.110 --> 00:18:52.380
Synchro Summon!

00:18:52.750 --> 00:18:56.290
The emissary of love and 
justice!  Power Tool Dragon!

00:18:57.670 --> 00:19:01.050
You have a card that I'm a bit excited about.

00:19:01.050 --> 00:19:06.310
Power Tool Dragon lets me add a random 
Equip Spell in my deck to my hand!

00:19:07.930 --> 00:19:11.150
I activate Double Tool C&D!

00:19:11.150 --> 00:19:15.750
During my turn, the equipped 
monster gains 1000 attack points!

00:19:15.770 --> 00:19:18.910
Double Tool equips on to Power Tool Dragon!

00:19:21.360 --> 00:19:23.780
Go, Power Tool Dragon!

00:19:23.780 --> 00:19:25.240
Crafty Break!

00:19:26.330 --> 00:19:28.480
Krebons's effect activates!

00:19:28.480 --> 00:19:34.940
When this card is the target of attack, I 
can pay 800 life points to negate your attack.

00:19:34.940 --> 00:19:37.250
That doesn't work!

00:19:37.250 --> 00:19:42.810
When a monster equipped with Double Tool 
attacks, your monster's effect is negated!

00:19:42.810 --> 00:19:43.690
What?

00:19:47.570 --> 00:19:49.110
Nicely done.

00:19:51.100 --> 00:19:52.070
That's right.

00:19:52.100 --> 00:19:57.480
I'm the fifth Signer!  I won't 
lose to someone like you!

00:19:57.480 --> 00:19:59.610
I will get Luca back!

00:20:00.780 --> 00:20:03.280
Lua, do your best.

00:20:03.280 --> 00:20:04.710
My turn.

00:20:04.710 --> 00:20:07.720
I activate the Continuous Spell Psi-Station!

00:20:07.720 --> 00:20:13.230
With this card, when a Psychic-Type monster 
is successfully summoned, I can pay

00:20:13.230 --> 00:20:19.230
500 life points to increase the monster's 
Level by one and its attack points by 300.

00:20:19.790 --> 00:20:23.640
From my hand, I summon the Tuner 
Monster Psychic Commander.

00:20:27.070 --> 00:20:32.840
I pay 500 life points to 
activate Psi-Station's effect!

00:20:35.130 --> 00:20:38.240
Psychic Commander's Level 
and attack points increase!

00:20:38.530 --> 00:20:40.950
The Tuner Monster becomes Level 4?

00:20:41.160 --> 00:20:47.270
Then Level 4 Psychic Commander 
tunes Level 4 Psychic Snail!

00:20:47.590 --> 00:20:50.760
Surge, my black fire of revenge!

00:20:51.050 --> 00:20:52.620
Synchro Summon!

00:20:52.620 --> 00:20:55.380
Come, Thought Ruler Archfiend!

00:21:07.130 --> 00:21:09.740
2700 attack points…

00:21:10.160 --> 00:21:13.520
However, Power Tool Dragon 
can send its Equip Card

00:21:13.520 --> 00:21:16.520
to the graveyard to negate 
its destruction in battle!

00:21:16.520 --> 00:21:19.310
I applaud you for giving 
me this much trouble.

00:21:19.310 --> 00:21:24.250
However, your talent is not 
what I was looking for.

00:21:24.250 --> 00:21:27.870
I activate the trap card 
Battle Teleportation.

00:21:27.870 --> 00:21:32.970
One Psychic-Type monster 
can attack you directly!

00:21:34.990 --> 00:21:38.180
Thought Ruler Archfiend, attack him directly!

00:21:44.190 --> 00:21:46.080
No way…

00:21:57.770 --> 00:22:02.800
He was a worthless piece of 
garbage.  What a waste of my time.

00:22:05.320 --> 00:22:08.910
Lua!

00:22:21.730 --> 00:22:26.200
We look up and vow towards the shining light

00:22:26.570 --> 00:22:31.280
We will build our own future

00:22:31.740 --> 00:22:36.710
The far dawn shines blindingly

00:22:37.180 --> 00:22:41.890
Awaken in the wonderland

00:22:47.490 --> 00:22:57.030
The overflowing wave of emotions approaches

00:22:57.460 --> 00:23:02.600
This world can’t be solved using algorithms

00:23:02.670 --> 00:23:07.310
Even if it loses its light

00:23:07.770 --> 00:23:12.580
The hourglass behind the 
heart can’t be turned

00:23:12.580 --> 00:23:17.050
Roll the dice and get 
out and follow the light

00:23:17.250 --> 00:23:22.630
Fly towards tomorrow faster than a heartbeat

00:23:22.760 --> 00:23:27.440
This journey has no end

00:23:27.730 --> 00:23:32.970
There’s no meaning 
because there are no tears

00:23:33.400 --> 00:23:38.210
Hear my voice
